  "sourceTitle": "Basic Cookie",
  "sourceText": "Basic Cookie\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, December 21, 2009 - 11:41pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup brown sugar\n1 cup white sugar\n1 cup shortening\n2 eggs\n2 cups oatmeal\n2 cups flour\n1 teaspoon soda\n1 teaspoon baking powder\n1/4 cup water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together in very large bowl. Dough will be stiff. Add either chocolate chips, raisins, M 2 , gum drops or whatever is your favorite before baking. Bake for 12 minutes at 375 degrees.",
